{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>秋天造訪日本，當然不能錯過當季的番薯美食！日本 FamilyMart 推出多款採用「紅遙番薯」（紅はるか）製作的秋季限定甜品，包括可麗露、泡芙、牛角包、法式蛋糕、雪糕等，最平港幣$9入手。</p><p>銷售期：9月22日起</p><p>為食出走 ｜ 用味蕾探索世界，由地道小食到追求極致的星級餐廳，每一啖都品嚐著每個城市最獨特的風味。哪一道美食令 recipients 念念不忘？即刻DM我哋分享你的為食出走經歷！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178997761721239961_17429141266ab0e4116122d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178997761863420080_9260081356ab0e412b8f92.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178997761965646136_7948253176ab0e4141bb55.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17899776210155231_12735111796ab0e41559ba5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178997762234570711_3419581176ab0e41671d38.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178997762361298354_17213210516ab0e417b0985.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/17899776247796720_3667513046ab0e4191a571.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178997762621115796_8735801916ab0e41a64896.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178997762737586819_16350419106ab0e41c076c6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/178997762904559393_10273483986ab0e41d2d2fb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p><p>Tags : FamilyMart IG精選 便利店食堂 全家</p><p>圖片來源：@familymart.japan 資料或影片來源： Gotrip IG</p><p>Sep 21 2026</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T08:18:46.017952+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":360,"images":10,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none"}}